WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.550
Kaoru, a Happy New Year!

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:11.177
This is a souvenir from Hawaii.

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.388
Thank you.

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:16.808
You got sunburned.

00:00:17.392 --> 00:00:19.185
I'm worried about the freckles.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.732
You're too young to worry about freckles.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:27.694
Oh, I have to.
My skin needs to be pretty by June.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.362
Why?

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:35.076
My boyfriend proposed to me in Hawaii.

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:37.787
So, I'd like to inform you

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:40.498
that I'll resign by the end of the year.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.292
You're resigning?

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:43.460
Yes.

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.755
I see.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.429
Congratulations.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.473
Thank you.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:59.642
I appreciate the support you've given me.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:09.152
Hawaii sounds good.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:11.863
It must be nice and warm over there.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:14.449
By the way,

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:17.702
macadamia nuts seem to be
the default souvenir from Hawaii.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:20.330
Couldn't she think of buying other things?

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:23.792
Come to think of it,

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:29.631
Mr. Kato and I were the only ones
getting macadamia nuts.

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:32.425
Mr. Kato, this is for you.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:34.135
Oh, thank you.

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:36.471
Mika got a bottle of nail polish.

00:01:38.389 --> 00:01:39.599
So pretty!

00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.976
Kojima got a lipstick.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.104
Oh, so that's what happened?

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:47.607
I find it strange. Don't you?

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:55.448
Besides, she's resigning due to marriage.

00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:57.575
What is that? "Resigning due to marriage"?

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:59.035
Do people still do that nowadays?

00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:00.787
Keep working, lady!

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:03.790
For the sake of the world,
of other people and the Earth.

00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:06.835
There's a saying, "No work, no food."

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:08.837
Don't you agree?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:19.055
Wait... No, I didn't mean that.

00:02:24.018 --> 00:02:26.062
I can't believe Sayu is resigning.

00:02:26.771 --> 00:02:28.815
I mean, her work is sloppy, but--

00:02:31.776 --> 00:02:33.695
I-I have acne!

00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:38.616
Wait, people don't call this acne
at my age.

00:02:38.741 --> 00:02:41.327
I-It's a boil!

